      "id": "mix127_full_wet_clamp",
      "location": "ChorusCore.cpp mix stage, after P:$1477CF (x0 = y:(r6+$7))",
      "description": "User decision: MIX=127 must give 100% wet. ROM computes x0=127*65536=0x7f0000 and derives the dry weight as 0x7fffff-x0=0x7fff, leaving ~0.78% dry in the full-wet output. The clamp sets x0=0x7fffff when it equals 0x7f0000, so the dry weight becomes 0 and the output is 0x7fffff/2^23 * wet (<=1 LSB, -138 dB). MIX=0 and all other values are bit-identical to the ROM path.",
